'' RUN: std/tls -- handshakes over loopback with the test PKI: verified by name and by IP,
'' a 200 000-byte echo, close_notify, untrusted, name mismatch, expired, InsecureSkipVerify,
'' MinVersion 1.3, config and state errors (C:\dev\docs\tiko-stdlib\RFC-0002).  Loopback
'' only; the same source runs on Linux.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -mt tests/codegen/src/std-tls.tiko -o tests/codegen/stdtls.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/stdtls.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/stdtls.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
